WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:03.403
Russia's paramilitary proxy group, Varna,

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.672
have begun to try and influence

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.873
one of the parties.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.641
They we believe from the evidence

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.143
that we've seen a recent

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:12.345
plying have been resupplying

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:13.580
the Rapid Support

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:14.681
Force paramilitary group.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.182
Take a look at this

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.286
the Sudanese and the Libyan army

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:21.988
celebrated a successful joint

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.089
operation Wednesday,

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.391
April 19th,

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:25.125
near the remote

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:26.993
desert border between Libya and Sudan.

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:27.861
Having captured

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:28.995
the Scheffer, that garrison

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:29.996
belonging to the rival

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:30.964
Sudanese paramilitary

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:33.166
rapid support forces, the RCAF.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.301
But why is this garrison important,

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:36.302
given how far it is

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:37.804
from the existential fight

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:41.307
in Sudan's capital, Khartoum?

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.443
Because CNN can reveal

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:44.778
that the fight in Khartoum

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:46.713
is being influenced by what was happening

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.381
at that garrison.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.383
A Russian resupply campaign

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:53.353
backed by a key regional player aimed

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:54.387
at turning the tide

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:57.190
in Sudan's war in favor of the RAAF,

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.525
who have been a key

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:00.160
recipient of Russian training

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.528
and military aid.

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:02.462
In collaboration

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.798
with All Eyes on Wagner, a research group

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:07.033
focusing on Russian proxy Wagner.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.935
CNN investigated the group's

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:10.503
current presence in Libya.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:12.739
You can see here on April 16th.

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:14.307
One day after the fighting

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.309
began in Khartoum, a Russian Aleutian.

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:17.444
76 transport

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:19.446
plane at the edge of a base in Libya

00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:20.647
previously identified

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:21.815
by American intelligence

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.349
as a Virginia base.

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:24.350
Three days later,

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.519
this same plane is spotted by

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:28.755
flight tracker aviation expert Gudgeon

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:30.924
coming back from the Russian airbase

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.492
in Latakia, Syria,

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:35.161
before returning to the Libyan airbase

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.162
in Haditha.

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:36.996
Images of that

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:38.031
same plane began

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:40.300
circulating online April 17th.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.802
Heading in the direction of Sudan.

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:44.270
Sudanese and regional sources

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.605
tell CNN that weaponry

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.140
was airdropped to the RAAF

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.641
within that timeframe.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:50.777
April 15th to April 18th

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.378
to the Chevrolet Garrison

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:54.714
during a period of fierce fighting,

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:57.984
boosting the ISF, the Alpha Adim

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.252
and algebra bases

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:00.520
where the Volga planes

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.188
departed from in Libya

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.523
under the control of Field

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:05.024
Marshal Khalifa Haftar,

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:06.326
who commands territory

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:07.961
in the east of Libya.

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:08.528
Haftar

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:09.963
and the commander of the rapid support

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:12.332
forces, Mohamed Hamdan Dagalo, a.k.a.

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:13.900
committee, have in common

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.003
strategic alliances, one with Valbuena,

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:19.172
who Haftar is hosting in his territory

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:19.906
in Libya,

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:20.440
and whom

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.242
a previous CNN investigation

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.244
exposed as working with Hemmati

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:26.279
to extract Sudanese gold.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.080
A second

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.047
with the United Arab

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:29.749
Emirates, who tapped him ready

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:31.784
to send forces to the conflict in Yemen

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:33.419
and backed Haftar

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:34.621
in the fighting in Libya.

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:37.157
What does it

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:37.824
all mean

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:38.691
for the ongoing

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:40.960
misery and conflict in Sudan?

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.796
It means that both a regional Libyan

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:44.664
General Haftar

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.132
and a global player

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:48.234
Russia are putting their thumbs

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.002
on the scale,

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:51.504
which raises the stakes for the region,

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:53.940
for the global balance of power,

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.942
and for the people of Sudan.

00:02:55.942 --> 00:02:58.645
Caught in the crossfire,

00:02:58.645 --> 00:03:01.648
we reached out to both Haftar and Wagner

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:03.283
and didn't receive a response

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:04.484
to our requests for comment

00:03:04.484 --> 00:03:05.118
and ourselves.

00:03:05.118 --> 00:03:06.686
Spokesperson denied

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:08.855
that they were currently receiving

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:10.623
support from Libya or Russia,

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:12.692
although they had previously denied

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:14.027
when our investigation

00:03:14.027 --> 00:03:16.062
exposed their relationship with Wagner

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:17.530
that there was a relationship.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.498
So at least this time

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:19.933
they've admitted that they had

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:21.301
a previous relationship.

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:22.569
For what that's worth, Jake.

